#: ../developer/adding-models.md:1
msgid "Adding a New Model"
msgstr "添加新模型"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to add LLM models and providers to the "
"HybridInference gateway while keeping the OpenAI-compatible API surface that"
" clients see."
msgstr ""
"本指南说明如何向 HybridInference 网关添加 LLM 模型与 provider，同时保持客户端看到的 OpenAI 兼容 API "
"接口不变。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:6
msgid ""
"There is a single guide for both needs. Depending on your case, follow one "
"of:"
msgstr "两种需求共用这一份指南。根据你的情况，选择其中一条路径："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:8
msgid ""
"Use an existing provider adapter — only registry YAML plus environment "
"changes."
msgstr "复用已有的 provider adapter——只需改注册表 YAML 和环境变量。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:9
msgid ""
"Integrate a new provider — add or wire an adapter, then the registry YAML "
"and environment."
msgstr "接入新的 provider——先添加或接上 adapter，再改注册表 YAML 和环境变量。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:12
msgid ""
"For a model you serve yourself on vLLM, SGLang, or Ollama, see [Adding a New"
" Local Model](add-local-model.md), which owns route registration for local "
"servers."
msgstr ""
"如果模型是你自己用 vLLM、SGLang 或 Ollama 提供服务的，见[添加新的本地模型](add-local-"
"model.md)——本地服务器的路由注册由那一篇负责。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:16
msgid "Where your model registry lives"
msgstr "模型注册表在哪里"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:18
msgid ""
"**There is no `config/models.yaml` in this repository.** The backend "
"resolves the registry path at startup in "
"`apps/backend/serving/config/distribution.py` "
"(`resolve_config_path(\"models\")`), with this precedence:"
msgstr ""
"**本仓库里没有 `config/models.yaml`**。后端在启动时于 "
"`apps/backend/serving/config/distribution.py`（`resolve_config_path(\"models\")`）解析注册表路径，优先级如下："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:23
msgid ""
"**`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`** (legacy alias `MODELS_CONFIG`). An explicit path "
"always wins."
msgstr "**`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`**（旧别名 `MODELS_CONFIG`）。显式给出的路径始终优先。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:25
msgid ""
"**A distribution manifest's `paths.models`** — used only when "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` names a manifest *and* "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`. Relative values in the manifest resolve "
"against the manifest's own directory. `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` defaults to"
" `dark`, where the manifest is loaded, validated, and logged for comparison "
"but never applied."
msgstr ""
"**distribution manifest 的 `paths.models`**——仅当 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` "
"指向一份 manifest *且* `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active` 时才使用。manifest 里的相对路径按 "
"manifest 自身所在目录解析。`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` 默认是 `dark`：manifest "
"会被加载、校验并写进日志以供比对，但不会真正生效。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:30
msgid ""
"**`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml`** — the bundled reference "
"registry a fresh checkout serves when nothing else is configured."
msgstr ""
"**`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml`**——仓库自带的参考注册表；全新检出在没有配置其他来源时就用它对外提供服务。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:33
msgid ""
"Routing configuration follows the same chain (`ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH` / "
"`paths.routing`, defaulting to `config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml`)."
msgstr ""
"路由配置走同一条解析链（`ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH` / `paths.routing`，默认为 "
"`config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml`）。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:36
msgid "So a self-hoster has two shapes to choose from:"
msgstr "所以自建部署有两种形态可选："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:38
msgid ""
"**Point at a file.** Keep your registry wherever you like and set "
"`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH=/path/to/models.yaml`. This is what the quickstart in "
"`README.md` does."
msgstr ""
"**指向一个文件**。注册表放在任意位置，设置 `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH=/path/to/models.yaml` "
"即可。`README.md` 里的快速开始就是这么做的。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:41
msgid ""
"**Ship an overlay.** Create `distributions/<name>/` containing a "
"`distribution.yaml` manifest and a `config/models.yaml`, then set "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH=distributions/<name>/distribution.yaml` and "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`. `distributions/example/` is a working "
"overlay you can copy; `config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` is an "
"annotated manifest."
msgstr ""
"**发布一个 overlay**。创建 `distributions/<name>/`，里面放一份 `distribution.yaml` "
"manifest 和一份 `config/models.yaml`，然后设置 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH=distributions/<name>/distribution.yaml` 和 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`。`distributions/example/` 是一个可以直接复制的可用 "
"overlay；`config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` 是一份带注释的 manifest。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:48
msgid ""
"Throughout this guide, \"your model registry\" means whichever file that "
"resolution picks."
msgstr "本指南中所说的「你的模型注册表」，指的就是上述解析过程最终选中的那个文件。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:51
msgid ""
"If no registry is found at the resolved path, the backend logs an error, "
"serves an empty `/v1/models`, and reports every model as not found."
msgstr "如果解析出的路径上没有注册表，后端会记录一条错误日志，`/v1/models` 返回空列表，并把每个模型都报为 not found。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:54
msgid "Quick Start: adding a model to an existing provider"
msgstr "快速开始：为已有 provider 添加模型"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:56
msgid "If the provider already has an adapter, you only need configuration."
msgstr "如果该 provider 已经有 adapter，只需要改配置。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:58
msgid "**Add a model entry** to your model registry:"
msgstr "在模型注册表中**添加一条模型条目**："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:90
msgid ""
"**Set the environment variables** in `.env` at the repository root (the "
"backend's settings loader reads that file):"
msgstr "在仓库根目录的 `.env` 里**设置环境变量**（后端的配置加载器读的就是这个文件）："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:98
msgid "**Restart the backend** to load the new model."
msgstr "**重启后端**以加载新模型。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:100
msgid ""
"**Verify** (see [Step 5: verify through the gateway](#step-5-verify-through-"
"the-gateway))."
msgstr "**验证**（见[第 5 步：通过网关验证](#step-5-verify-through-the-gateway)）。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:102
msgid ""
"Note on aliases: to let clients also call the model under a second name — an"
" OpenRouter-style vendor slug, or the raw model path your serving runtime "
"uses — list those names in `aliases`. They resolve to the same routes."
msgstr ""
"关于 aliases：如果想让客户端也能用第二个名字调用这个模型——比如 OpenRouter 风格的厂商 "
"slug，或者你的推理运行时使用的原始模型路径——把这些名字列进 `aliases`。它们解析到同一组路由。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:106
msgid "Adding a New Provider"
msgstr "添加新的 provider"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:108
msgid "Step 1: decide whether you need an adapter at all"
msgstr "第 1 步：先判断到底需不需要 adapter"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:110
msgid ""
"Most new providers expose an OpenAI-style `/chat/completions` endpoint. For "
"those, **do not write an adapter class.** Register a provider profile and "
"add the kind to the OpenAI-compat dispatch tuple in "
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` (`_make_adapter`):"
msgstr ""
"多数新 provider 都提供 OpenAI 风格的 `/chat/completions` 端点。对这类 provider，**不要写 "
"adapter 类**。注册一个 provider profile，并把这个 kind 加进 "
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` 中的 OpenAI "
"兼容分发元组（`_make_adapter`）："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:137
msgid ""
"This is how `deepseek`, `kimi`, and `minimax` are integrated today: a per-"
"provider profile in `apps/backend/serving/adapters/profiles.py` carries the "
"usage-metric or path quirks, and `OpenAICompatAdapter` does the rest. `zai` "
"and `kimi_coding` use the same profile mechanism but are gated on a coding-"
"tool identity, so `_make_adapter` short-circuits them to "
"`CodingIdentityAdapter` (a thin `OpenAICompatAdapter` subclass) before "
"reaching that tuple."
msgstr ""
"`deepseek`、`kimi` 和 `minimax` "
"现在就是这样接入的：`apps/backend/serving/adapters/profiles.py` 里每个 provider 一份的 "
"profile 承载用量指标或路径上的差异，其余全部交给 `OpenAICompatAdapter`。`zai` 和 `kimi_coding` "
"用的是同一套 profile 机制，但它们额外绑定了一个 coding 工具身份，所以 `_make_adapter` "
"会在走到那个元组之前，先把它们短路到 `CodingIdentityAdapter`（`OpenAICompatAdapter` 的一个很薄的子类）。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:144
msgid ""
"Write a dedicated adapter only when the provider speaks a genuinely non-"
"OpenAI wire format — Gemini's `generateContent`, the Anthropic Messages API,"
" OpenRouter's provider-pinning body fields. `gemini`, `claude`, `anthropic`,"
" and `openrouter` all follow that pattern, each with its own dispatch "
"branch:"
msgstr ""
"只有当 provider 说的确实不是 OpenAI 的 wire 格式时，才写专门的 adapter——例如 Gemini 的 "
"`generateContent`、Anthropic Messages API、OpenRouter 用来锁定 sub-provider 的 body"
" 字段。`gemini`、`claude`、`anthropic` 和 `openrouter` 都属于这一类，各自有独立的分发分支："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:154
msgid "Step 2: write the adapter (custom protocols only)"
msgstr "第 2 步：编写 adapter（仅限自定义协议）"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:156
msgid ""
"Create a new file under `apps/backend/serving/adapters/`, for example "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/your_provider.py`. The backend package root "
"is `apps/backend`, so imports are written as `serving.…` / `routing.…`:"
msgstr ""
"在 `apps/backend/serving/adapters/` 下新建一个文件，例如 "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/your_provider.py`。后端的包根目录是 `apps/backend`，因此 "
"import 写成 `serving.…` / `routing.…`："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:311
msgid "Export it from `apps/backend/serving/adapters/__init__.py`:"
msgstr "在 `apps/backend/serving/adapters/__init__.py` 里导出它："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:322
msgid ""
"and import it at the top of `apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py`:"
msgstr "并在 `apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` 顶部导入它："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:331
msgid "Step 3: add the model to your registry"
msgstr "第 3 步：把模型加进注册表"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:364
msgid "Step 4: configure environment variables"
msgstr "第 4 步：配置环境变量"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:366
msgid "Add to `.env`:"
msgstr "加进 `.env`："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:373
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A route whose `${VAR}`-backed `api_key`, `api_keys`, or `base_url` resolves "
"to empty is not registered. By default that drops the whole model, and the "
"backend logs which models were skipped and which variables were unset. Mark "
"a route `optional: true` to have only that route be skipped instead, leaving"
" the rest of the model registered."
msgstr ""
"一条路由的 `api_key`、`api_keys` 或 `base_url` 若由 `${VAR}` "
"提供而解析结果为空，这条路由不会被注册。默认情况下整个模型都会被丢弃，后端会记录哪些模型被跳过、哪些变量没设置。给路由标上 `optional: "
"true`，就只跳过这一条路由，模型的其余部分照常注册。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:379
msgid "Step 5: verify through the gateway"
msgstr "第 5 步：通过网关验证"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:381
msgid "Start the backend. From a checkout, the quickstart form is:"
msgstr "启动后端。在一个检出里，最快的启动形式是："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:389
msgid ""
"With the bundled Docker Compose setup, `make build s=backend` rebuilds and "
"restarts the backend instead."
msgstr "如果用仓库自带的 Docker Compose，则改用 `make build s=backend` 重新构建并重启 backend。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:392
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/models` accepts an anonymous request — it resolves an API key only "
"to decide whether to include admin-visible entries:"
msgstr "`GET /v1/models` 接受匿名请求——它解析 API key 只是为了决定要不要包含仅管理员可见的条目："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:399
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/chat/completions` runs through `verify_api_key`, so **it returns "
"401 without a valid gateway API key** unless the backend is running with "
"`USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false`. Send the key you issued for your own gateway "
"(this is the gateway's key, not the upstream provider's):"
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/chat/completions` 会经过 `verify_api_key`，因此**没有有效的网关 API key 就会返回 "
"401**，除非后端以 `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false` 运行。请发送你为自己的网关签发的 key（是网关的 key，不是上游 "
"provider 的）："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:416
msgid "Streaming test:"
msgstr "流式测试："

