"Default fields merged into OpenAI-compatible upstream request bodies. Core "
"fields and validated client parameters win"
msgstr "合并进 OpenAI 兼容上游请求体的默认字段。核心字段和已校验的客户端参数优先"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`priority_scheduling`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"The endpoint runs an sglang server started with `--enable-priority-"
"scheduling`; see [Prioritizing decode on an sglang route](add-local-"
"model.md#prioritizing-decode-on-an-sglang-route). Normally set per route, "
"not per model"
msgstr ""
"该端点上的 sglang 服务器是带 `--enable-priority-scheduling` 启动的；见[在 sglang 路由上优先调度 "
"decode](add-local-model.md#prioritizing-decode-on-an-sglang-"
"route)。通常按路由设置，而不是按模型设置"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`route_metadata`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Free-form per-route metadata consumed by routing strategies"
msgstr "供路由策略消费的、每条路由上的自由格式元数据"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`pricing`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Base cost information, USD per 1M tokens (and per request)"
msgstr "基础成本信息，单位是每 100 万 token 的美元数（以及每请求的美元数）"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`pricing_schedule`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"UTC-only activation time plus recurring daily price windows: `pricing` stays"
" active before `effective_at`; afterwards `default` applies outside each "
"half-open `[start, end)` window, and a window's own `pricing` overrides the "
"base fields"
msgstr ""
"只按 UTC 计的生效时间，加上每天重复的价格时间窗：`effective_at` 之前继续使用 `pricing`；之后，落在每个左闭右开 "
"`[start, end)` 窗口之外的时段适用 `default`，而窗口自带的 `pricing` 覆盖基础字段"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:465
msgid ""
"A few model-entry keys are not `ModelConfig` fields and are consumed "
"elsewhere: `route` (below), `router` and `router_params` (per-model router "
"selection), `admin_only`, and `required_role`."
msgstr ""
"模型条目里有几个键并不是 `ModelConfig` 的字段，而是在别处被消费：`route`（见下）、`router` 和 "
"`router_params`（按模型选择 router）、`admin_only`、`required_role`。"

