#: ../developer/adding-models.md:604
msgid ""
"Handle the image content blocks in your adapter's `chat_completion`. A route"
" may declare narrower `input_modalities` than the model, so a text-only "
"fallback never receives media."
msgstr ""
"在 adapter 的 `chat_completion` 里处理图像内容块。单条路由可以声明比模型更窄的 "
"`input_modalities`，这样纯文本的回退路由就永远不会收到媒体内容。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:608
