msgid "Structured output (JSON mode)"
msgstr "结构化输出（JSON mode）"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:642
msgid "Handle the `response_format` parameter:"
msgstr "处理 `response_format` 参数："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:649
msgid "Rate limiting"
msgstr "限流"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:651
msgid ""
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/bootstrap.py` does not configure per-provider "
"rate limiters. The only in-process limiter wired there is "
"`UserConcurrencyLimiter`. Static auth-flow limits live in "
"`apps/backend/serving/config/settings.py` (the `signup_rate_limit_*` and "
"`login_rate_limit_*` fields). A per-provider token-bucket or quota would go "
"in `apps/backend/serving/admin/provider_quotas.py` (or a new module) and be "
"surfaced through `apps/backend/serving/servers/deps.py`."
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/bootstrap.py` 并没有配置按 provider "
"的限流器。那里接线的唯一进程内限流器是 `UserConcurrencyLimiter`。鉴权流程的静态限流值在 "
"`apps/backend/serving/config/settings.py`（`signup_rate_limit_*` 和 "
"`login_rate_limit_*` 字段）。若要做按 provider 的令牌桶或配额，应放进 "
"`apps/backend/serving/admin/provider_quotas.py`（或一个新模块），并通过 "
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/deps.py` 暴露出来。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:659
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:661
msgid ""
"**OpenAI-compatible provider.** DeepSeek has no adapter file. "
"`_make_adapter` in `apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` sets "
"`provider_profile = \"deepseek\"` and returns `OpenAICompatAdapter`; the "
"profile lives in `apps/backend/serving/adapters/profiles.py`."
msgstr ""
"**OpenAI 兼容的 provider**。DeepSeek 没有 adapter "
"文件。`apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` 里的 `_make_adapter` 设置 "
"`provider_profile = \"deepseek\"` 并返回 `OpenAICompatAdapter`；profile 本身在 "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/profiles.py`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:665
msgid ""
"**Custom API format.** See `apps/backend/serving/adapters/gemini.py` for "
"message conversion against a non-OpenAI wire format."
msgstr ""
"**自定义 API 格式**。针对非 OpenAI wire 格式的消息转换，见 "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/gemini.py`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:667
msgid ""
"**Local deployment.** vLLM and SGLang reuse "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/openai_compat.py`. The `vllm` and `sglang` "
"kinds dispatch to the same class; local-vs-remote behaviour comes from "
"`base_url` and the routing layer, not from a dedicated adapter."
msgstr ""
"**本地部署**。vLLM 和 SGLang 复用 "
"`apps/backend/serving/adapters/openai_compat.py`。`vllm` 和 `sglang` 这两个 kind "
"分发到同一个类；本地与远程的行为差异来自 `base_url` 和路由层，而不是来自专门的 adapter。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:672
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "排查"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:674
msgid "Model not appearing in `/v1/models`"
msgstr "模型没有出现在 `/v1/models` 里"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:676
msgid ""
"Confirm the registry the backend actually loaded. It logs `Registered N "
"routes from <path>` at startup, and logs an error naming the path when no "
"registry is there."
msgstr ""
"确认后端实际加载的是哪份注册表。它在启动时会记录 `Registered N routes from "
"<path>`；如果那个路径上没有注册表，则会记录一条写明路径的错误日志。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:679
msgid "Check the YAML syntax and indentation under `models:`."
msgstr "检查 `models:` 下的 YAML 语法和缩进。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:680
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Check for skipped models: a route whose `${VAR}`-backed key or `base_url` "
"resolves empty drops the model, and the log names both the model and the "
"unset variable."
msgstr ""
"检查是否有模型被跳过：一条路由的 key 或 `base_url` 若由 `${VAR}` "
"提供且解析为空，该模型就会被丢弃，日志里会同时写出模型名和未设置的变量名。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:683
msgid ""
"If using `aliases`, verify the canonical `id` appears exactly once and "
"aliases do not collide with another model's. A duplicate alias resolves to "
"whichever model loads last, and is logged as a warning."
msgstr ""
"如果用了 `aliases`，确认规范的 `id` 只出现一次，且别名没有和别的模型撞名。重复的别名会解析到最后加载的那个模型，并记录一条警告。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:687
msgid "Authentication failures"
msgstr "鉴权失败"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:689
msgid ""
"A 401 from the gateway means your **gateway** API key was missing or "
"invalid, or auth is enabled and you sent no `Authorization` header."
msgstr "网关返回的 401 表示你的**网关** API key 缺失或无效，或者鉴权已开启而你没有发送 `Authorization` 头。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:691
msgid ""
"A 401 surfaced from the route means the **upstream** key is wrong. The "
"backend logs it as `upstream_auth_misconfig` with the endpoint id and the "
"upstream's own error body."
msgstr ""
"从路由透出来的 401 表示**上游**的 key 不对。后端会把它记为 `upstream_auth_misconfig`，并带上端点 id "
"和上游自己的错误响应体。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:694
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Check that `${ENV_VAR}` expansion resolved: only a value of exactly the form"
" `${NAME}` is expanded, and only for `base_url`, `api_key`, `api_keys`, and "
"`provider_model_id`."
msgstr ""
"确认 `${ENV_VAR}` 展开成功：只有恰好是 `${NAME}` 这种形式的取值才会被展开，而且只对 "
"`base_url`、`api_key`、`api_keys` 和 `provider_model_id` 生效。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:698
msgid "Response format errors"
msgstr "响应格式错误"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:700
msgid "Ensure `format_response()` returns the OpenAI-compatible structure."
msgstr "确保 `format_response()` 返回 OpenAI 兼容的结构。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:701
msgid "Validate that `UsageInfo` fields are integers."
msgstr "校验 `UsageInfo` 的各字段都是整数。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:702
msgid ""
"Check `finish_reason` is one of `stop`, `length`, `content_filter`, "
"`tool_calls`."
msgstr ""
"检查 `finish_reason` 是 `stop`、`length`、`content_filter`、`tool_calls` 之一。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:704
msgid ""
"For streaming, emit the first non-empty content chunk as soon as it is "
"available so time-to-first-token is recorded accurately."
msgstr "流式场景下，第一个非空内容分片一可用就立刻发出，这样首 token 时延（time-to-first-token）才会被准确记录。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:707
msgid "Streaming issues"
msgstr "流式问题"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:709
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Ensure chunks are SSE-formatted: `data: {json}\\n\\n`."
msgstr "确保分片是 SSE 格式：`data: {json}\\n\\n`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:710
msgid "Send the final usage chunk before `data: [DONE]`."
msgstr "在 `data: [DONE]` 之前发送最后那个 usage 分片。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:711
msgid "Handle JSON parsing errors gracefully."
msgstr "妥善处理 JSON 解析错误。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:713
msgid "Best practices"
msgstr "最佳实践"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:715
msgid ""
"**Error handling** — use `self.http.json_post_with_retry()` and surface "
"provider faults with useful messages."
msgstr ""
"**错误处理**——用 `self.http.json_post_with_retry()`，并用有价值的信息把 provider 的故障暴露出来。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:717
msgid ""
"**Usage accounting** — prefer provider-reported usage; fall back to "
"`estimate_prompt_tokens()` / `estimate_text_tokens()`."
msgstr ""
"**用量记账**——优先采用 provider 上报的 usage；拿不到再回退到 `estimate_prompt_tokens()` / "
"`estimate_text_tokens()`。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:719
msgid ""
"**Streaming helpers** — use `format_stream_chunk()`, "
"`make_final_usage_chunk()`, and `done_sentinel()` for consistent SSE."
msgstr ""
"**流式辅助函数**——用 `format_stream_chunk()`、`make_final_usage_chunk()` 和 "
"`done_sentinel()` 保证 SSE 输出一致。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:721
msgid ""
"**Type safety** — full type hints, and keep request/response shapes aligned "
"with `apps/backend/serving/schemas.py`."
msgstr ""
"**类型安全**——写完整的类型标注，并让请求/响应的结构与 `apps/backend/serving/schemas.py` 保持一致。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:723
msgid ""
"**Testing** — exercise both streaming and non-streaming paths, and try large"
" prompts to validate token clamping."
msgstr "**测试**——流式和非流式两条路径都要跑到，并用大 prompt 验证 token 的钳制逻辑。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:725
msgid ""
"**Docs & style** — Google-style docstrings in English; keep provider-"
"specific logic out of shared code."
msgstr "**文档与风格**——用英文写 Google 风格的 docstring；不要把 provider 专属的逻辑塞进共享代码。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:727
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Secrets** — use `${ENV_VAR}` in YAML rather than hardcoding keys or "
"endpoints, and keep the values in `.env`."
msgstr "**密钥**——在 YAML 里用 `${ENV_VAR}`，不要硬编码 key 或端点，取值放在 `.env` 中。"

